# "This spell costs {1} less to cast if it targets a creature with flying" and "Enchanted creature gets -5/-3". Bot2's Serra Angel (4/4
# flying) is the target, so Swampsnare Trap costs {1}{B}: Mox Jet and Mox Ruby pay it exactly, nothing floats and Mox Pearl stays untapped.
# The Angel is -1/1 (a power one off in either direction or a toughness one off would show), alive, and still has flying.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Swampsnare Trap
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Serra Angel
Plains x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Serra Angel.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Serra Angel.Power = 4
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swampsnare Trap.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Serra Angel)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Tapped = false
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Serra Angel.Power = -1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Serra Angel.Toughness = 1

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Serra Angel.Keywords = Flying; Vigilance
